        StaticItem("Hope's End", "When you grasp the sword it gives off an eerie feeling,\nsoft whispers entering your head. If you were to attempt\nto make them out, you would find them to be two different\nvoices(PM Roxses20). The sword itself is beautifully\ncrafted and looks rather old, though it holds strong to the\ntests of time. The swords blade itself is oddly colored, half\nbeing pitch black and the other a normal steel color. The\ncenter of the cross guard would be a decorated black rose,\nvines with thorns wrapping around the rest of the cross\nguard sprouting out of the flower. If you held the power\nof a Shade or by chance stab one, the shade would feel\nthe sword tugging at its taint as if eating it. Its power\ndrained as the sword becomes more empowered, a\nblack flame coating it. If it to were remain touched by\nthe shade for too long they would be immensely weakened.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
