        StaticItem("The Voidgazer’s Compass", "An unusual navigational instrument rests in your\nhands. Enchanted at the hands of Archmage Crumena\nof the Mages' Guild. Well a compact device whose domed\ncover was made from pure lapis lazuli. The inside lid is\ndetailed with a map of the heavens, always every shifted\nto accommodate it's environment. The central shadow\nvane makes compass work as a sundial, and the compass\ndisk itself was sliced from a walrus's tusk. Beneath the\nneedle of the compass, the disk itself appear to be\nshrouded in a black substance. Taken from a peculiar\nfountain hidden beneath the surface of the Fringe as it\nreflects a Nebula-like effect. As if the owner was gazing\ninto the depths of the Void itself. The most prominent\nfeature being that the compass' needle points large Voidal\nanomalies and destructive phenomenon, rather than\nmere magnetic North.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Smooth Sunday Bison Ride", "Some Dank Kush!\n*Moderator Approved*\nMysticWalrus approved this item.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Cleric Anvil", "It is said that this anvil was sent from the\nSeven Skies in order to forge great\nrelics blessed with the powers of Taharaie.\n*Moderator Approved*\nMysticWalrus approved this item.", "minecraft:anvil", ""),
        StaticItem("Advent's Receptacle", "Arcane X\nMagic V\nA large, thick block for what appears to be\nsolid Ferrum. Intertwining Arcane marks are\netched into the object's surface. Winding\nfrom face to face of the prism. As you\nhold the item in your hand it becomes\nobvious that an eldritched force surrounds it.\nYet the the most noteable feature being that\na faint pulsating sensation can be felt from\nthe center of the object. Almost like that of\na steady heart beat.\n[PM HeeroZero to interact.]\n*Moderator Approved*\nMysticWalrus approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Edgy Award", "Edgy!!!\nRazor sharp\nmaster cooking knife\nblood red eyes\n*Moderator Approved*\nfirespirit44 approved this item", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
