        StaticItem("The Realm Walker’s Cicerone", "A large and somewhat cumbersome staff made for an\nOrc. Carved from the sacred wood of a Winged tree,\nalso known as a Wolhaiksong in the tongue of the Bohra.\nA large Arcaurum lantern hangs from the tip of the staff.\nA fierce green spectral flame roars within the bounds of\nthe lantern. Crafted underneath the shadow of an eclipse\nthe staff grants a highly skilled Shaman to pave the way\nfor a group spirit walk. A delve into the spiritual plane to\nwitness it and even interact slightly with it’s enrichening\nenvironment.\n*Moderator Approved*\nMysticWalrus approved this item.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
