        StaticItem("Necrotic Blade", "The blade's steel seems eerily blackened,\ndecrepid but still full in durability and use. If picked up by living beings\nit will cause them to rot and be drained of their life-force.\nOtherwise when used, it will cause the afflicted area to rot, and drain it of\nlife-force until it is fully incapable of use. (A fair time after strike.)\n*Moderator Approved*\nSlic3man approved this item.\n[!] Useable only by Spectres/Necrolytes.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
