        StaticItem("-Charged Ore-", "The amorphous crystal pulsates with\nraw energy. The air about it taking\non a distinctive, coppery taste.\n*Moderator Approved*\nArzota approved this item.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Eye", "A remnant of a lost age, this archaic necklace\nhas a shining blue gem strung onto the front.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Tempered Curtana", "A ceremonical blade, tinged purple\nby some outside force. The edge is\nhoned to a percice edge, able to\nslice skin and bone, as if they were\nbutter.\n*Moderator Approved*\nArzota approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cloth Helm of Deflection", "An enchanted hood, woven of\nsilken cloth, imbued with the power\ndeflection.\n*Moderator Approved*\nArzota approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Rune-filled tome.", "", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Frostbane", "A dagger whose blade was a blueish\ngray colour. The hilt was standard\nfor a dagger. The blade of the\ndagger had an unnatural cold,\nbiting at the dagger's victim with\nan excruciatingly painful cold, as\nwell as hallucinations and\nincoherent whispers. Any Arcane\nusers would note this piece has\nsome, if not minor, magical\nresistance. In time, you'll find\nthe weapon slowly turns to a faded\nyellow color.\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Cloth Pants of Deflection", "Enchanted pants, made of\nsilken cloth, imbued with the power\ndeflection.\n*Moderator Approved*\nArzota approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Cloth Boots of Deflection", "Enchanted boots, made of\nsilken cloth, imbued with the power\nof deflection.\n*Moderator Approved*\nArzota approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Cloth Robes of Deflection", "An enchanted robe, woven of\nsilken cloth, imbued with the power\ndeflection.\n*Moderator Approved*\nArzota approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Frostbite", "A longsword of an odd metal. The silvery\nblue blade is marked with an engraving that\nresembles a heater shield with an eagle\nhead jutting from the top. The rest of\nthe blade was mundane: a cross guard of\nsteel, a comfortable leather wrapped\nhandle, and a jewel shaped pommel of\nsteel.\n-+-\nYou'd find that the blade of\nthe weapon has a chilling aura about it.\nNot only does it bring an excruciatingly\npainful cold bite to whom it attacked,\nit also had some, if not minor, magical\nresistance, and any who were slashed would\nalso be riddled with minor hallucinations,\nas though the sword was imbued with an odd\npoison. As long time passes, you'd note\nthe sword turns to a faded yellow color,\ntruly an odd metal.\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tower Shield of Deflection", "The sheild stands as tall as an average\nman, and weights just as much.\nDespite this, powerful enchantments\non the implement make it near impervious\nto magical attack.\n*Moderator Approved*\nArzota approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_door", ""),
        StaticItem("Archaic Stave", "A silver, steel, and wood ornate stave appears\nin perfect condition, even through the\ntides of time. When held, a sense of power courses\nthrough its wielder, thought it is all it can do for now...\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of the Hag", "A gnarled staff, trembling slightly with a residual power of the Hengfors Witch.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("An'talas", "A lengthy greatstaff of ashwood craft capped with\nan ornate tree inlain with sapphire and arcaurum.\nGlowing inscriptions traverse the shaft, exhuming a powerful\narcane aura and melodic thrums. A silken violet\nribbon hangs from the base of the staff,\nwrithing in the breeze.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("An Old Crossbow", "The initials L.S. are engraved.\n*Moderator Approved*\nKowaman approved this item.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf engraved medallion", "*Moderator Approved*\nCosmicWhaleShark approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Sated Crystal", "The essence of another being would seem to be tied to the crystal.\nThe very material it is made of would seem to put out a warm glow of power.", "minecraft:ender_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Ruibrium", "A vial of liquid holding a deep red hue,\nthe contents within proving to hold\na vast variety of uses...\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Amnesia, The Reach of Horrors", "A sword forged from black, twisted iron. It is wickedly sharp and inhumane. The weapon\nhad orginally been pried from the clutches of an Undead minion. The blade's length\nhas several, miniscule wisps of an onyx mist excreting outwards, having been tainted at\nthe hands of a powerful Weaver - Necromancer - upon slashing into its victim,\ntheir life is sluggishly sapped away, fueling the taint.\n*Moderator Approved*\nTsuyose approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Seed of Stratum", "A small, crystalline structure holding\nimmense power. Coloured with the aura\nof the holder, a mysterious essence\nis evoked from its image. Only when\nimbued with the power of a revenant\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Greg's Pocketwatch", "The golden pocketwatch seems to be enscribed with\nintricate and illegiable patterns, curves and edges embedded\nwithin. It seems to tick at a normal pace until mana is\nforced inward, causing the handles to spin with perpectual\nmotion and suddenly a bubble of wards shielding the\nuser from the arcane becomes formed.\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Edwyn's cane", "The crude spruce cane would be topped with an iron cap.\n*Moderator Approved*\ni_am_Ricky approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Adminium Scimitar", "*Moderator Approved*\nCosmicWhaleShark approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Frostbrand", "A short sword whose blade was a\nblueish gray colour. The hilt was\nequipped with a guard, finely\nwrapped leather handle, and a\ncircular pommel. The sword's blade\nhad an unnatural cold, biting into\nits victims flesh with excruciatingly\npainful cold, as well as hallucinations\nand incoherent whispers.\n-+-\nAny Arcane\nuser would find the piece to have\nminor magical resistance, as well as\nmaking their voidal prowess unstable\nif impaled.\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Messer of Thesseues", "This knife like sword is hued a gray-blue color along the blade, carrying with it\nembroideries of a snarling wolf and open eyes. Even now, the single edged blade carries\na sharpened edge and a good point.\n*Moderator Approved*\nCosmicWhaleShark approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
